  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of the Senegalese Warehouses Project in Bamako, Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at constructing storage facilities in Bamako owned by Senegal for achieving the following objectives: Enabling the storage of goods arriving to Bamako from Dakar, Easing the promoting of goods produced in Senegal and promoting Malian products in Senegal.</narrative>
  </description>
